6.1 Tool Ergonomics & Fuzzy Context Search-and-Replace: Claude Code does not use raw unified diff patches (which frequently fail due to line number drift). It uses a surgical search-and-replace tool: { "file_path": "path/to/file.py", "old_string": "def parse(val):
    return int(val)", "new_string": "def parse(val):
    if val is None:
        return 0
    return int(val)" } If whitespace or indentation differs slightly, the tool utilizes AST or fuzzy indentation matc
